@startuml
title Package Diagram — Project Structure
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

' Bootstrap / seeding
package "bootstrap" {
  class DataSeeder
}

package "domain" {
  class CampusUser
  class Cart
  class DeliveryLocation
  class DeliverySlot
  class DietaryTag
  class Dish
  class DishCategory
  class ExtraOption
  class FilterCriteria
  class Order
  class OrderItem
  class OrderStatus
  class Payment
  class PaymentMethod
  class Restaurant
  class RestaurantFilters
  class StudentCredit
}

package "repository" {
  class CampusUserRepository
  class CartRepository
  class DeliveryCatalogRepository
  class OrderRepository
  class RestaurantRepository
}

package "service" {
  class CartService
  class OrderDraftService
  class OrderService
}

package "handlers" {
  class BaseHandler
  class CampusUserHandler
  class CartHandler
  class OrderHandler
  class RestaurantHandler
}


package "app" {
  class Main
  class BackendFixture
}

' Package-level dependencies (direction indicates usage)
DataSeeder ..> repository : seeds / initializes
Main ..> handlers : wires handlers
Main ..> bootstrap : starts seeding

handlers --> service : calls / orchestrates
handlers --> domain : reads/writes domain objects

service --> repository : persists / loads
service --> domain : manipulates domain

repository --> domain : stores domain objects

note left of service
  - business logic lives here
  - depends on repositories + domain
end note

note right of repository
  - simple, in-memory test repos
  - used by tests and seeder
end note

@enduml
